#. module: om_quality
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_quality
msgid ""
"\n"
"Quality management: control points say what to check, where and how often (every time, every Nth,\n"
"a random share, once per lot, every X days); checks are recorded on a touch-friendly screen with\n"
"pass/fail buttons, measures against limits, photos and notes; a blocking check holds the document\n"
"until it passes or a manager overrides it with a reason; failures raise non-conformances with root\n"
"cause, cost and corrective and preventive actions, followed by quality teams through their stages.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: om_quality
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/om_quality/models/om_quality_document_mixin.py:0
msgid ""
"%(documents)s waits for these quality checks. Pass them, decide what to do "
"with a failed one, or ask a quality manager to override them; then try "
"again."
msgstr ""

